"harmonics.aspects.help"            = "This screen shows all aspects between the harmonic positions for the harmonic number you entered in the field at the top. The aspects and orbs are taken from your configuration, the same as for the aspect lines in the harmonic drawing.\n\nFor each aspect you see the two factors, the aspect, the orb and the exactness. The exactness is 100% for an exact aspect and decreases to 0% at the maximum orb.\n\nThe aspects are sorted from most exact to least exact.";
